<title>MALTA: Malta inflation slightly down.</title>
<headline>Malta inflation slightly down.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inflation in Malta stood at 2.49 per cent in December compared to 3.98 per cent in December 1995, the Malta Central Office of Statistics said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
